Package: mlmfe
Title: Bias-corrected Multilevel Models, Fixed Effects Models, and Regularized Fixed Effects Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Leonard", "Wainstein", email = "lwainstein@reed.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package implements bias-corrected multilevel models, fixed effects models, and (bias-corrected) regularized fixed effects models, as described in Bai et al. (2026) and Hazlett and Wainstein (2022). 
